        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Middlesex County area, Saugus, Massachusetts\n- Products: Burlington Mall, Shops at Billerica, Square One Mall, Acton Plaza, Middlesex Commons\n- Topics: shopping venues, shopping malls\n\nFacts:\n- Burlington Mall is one of many shopping venues in the Middlesex County area.\n- Other shopping venues in the Middlesex County area include the Shops at Billerica, Square One Mall, Acton Plaza, and Middlesex Commons.\n- Square One Mall was formerly named the New England Shopping Center.\n- Square One Mall is a 115-store shopping mall in Saugus, Massachusetts.\n- Square One Mall is located along US Route 1 (Broadway) between Main Street and Essex Street in Saugus, Massachusetts.",
